<title>SINGAPORE: World coffee supply tight, rally to continue - Gauze.</title>
<headline>World coffee supply tight, rally to continue - Gauze.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>World coffee supplies are very tight and the current strong rally in international coffee prices will not ease soon, the Commodity Minister of the Ivory Coast said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
